{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-057.md","record_count":21,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்ப புரிஞ்சுதா ராணிக்கு உயிர் வந்த ரகசியம்...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எப்படியோ என் ராணி பிழைச்சிடுச்சி..","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா! நான் செய்த குற்றங்களை யெல்லாம் மன்னித்து விடுங்கள்... (காலில் விழுகிறாள்)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எழுந்திரிம்மா...இந்த தள்ளாத வயசுலே என்னை எங்க, தனியா தவிக்கவிட்டுட்டு போயிடுவியோன்னு நெனைச்சேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்பத்தான் எல்லாம்நல்லாவே முடிஞ்சுபோச்சே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்க குடும்பத்திலும் சச்சரவு ஏற்படவும் நான் தான் காரணமா இருந்தேன்—நீங்களும் மன்னிச்சுடுங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மறப்போம்; மன்னிப்போம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி, நீ விழவேண்டிய காலு இன்னும் ஒண்ணு பாக்கியிருக்கு. இந்தம்மாதான் உன் மேலே ரொம்ப கோபமாயிருக்காங்க. இதயாரு மொதல்ல, அவுங்க கால்ல விழு!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகராசியா இரும்மா!...காதலர் இருவர் கருத்தொருமித்து ஆதரவுபட்டதே இன்பம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹீ...ஹீ...அதை நீ சொல்லிட்டியா?...நான் சொல்லலாம்னு இருந்தேன்...சரி; குறள் எல்லாருக்கும் பொது...விடு.\n(சத்தம் கேட்கவே) யாரது...என்னு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆகாகா—தகராறு! பெரிய தகராறு...பெரிய தகராறு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"காதலிச்சாச்சு...யாரு மொதல்ல மாலை போடறதுன்னு தகராறு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"காதலிச்சாச்சுல்ல. அப்ப ‘கேப்’ விடப்புடாது! இந்த விஷயத்திலே லேட் பண்ணினா அப்புறம் அது விஷம் வரையிலும் போயிடும். மொதல்ல மாலையைப் போடு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சங்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நானுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா பொண்ணு இங்கவா! இவனா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப சரி...சமரசம். எல்லாம் நல்லவிதமா முடிஞ்சுது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":77}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா, நல்லவிதமா முடிஞ்சுது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":78}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப நீங்களெல்லாம் கொஞ்சம் ஒதுங்கிக்கிறீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":78}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s057-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s057","scene_ordinal":57,"transition_audit_id":"T057","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ம்...புரிஞ்சுபோச்சு. நாங்க வர்ரோம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":78}],"source_scene_file":"scene-057.md"}]}